Z||000000||jlhuber||02-27-2000||06:23 PM||||has anyone painted or seen a gt in the color of "hugger orange" as found on older camaros?  i took a pic of my red gt and the lighting hit it just right to make it look almost like it was hugger orange.  i am going to repaint her when i get done fixing the body and was curiouse as to if anyone had seen one in that color.  also, i am in need of some lower rocker panels (gt ground effects?) from an '86 gt.  i see that the fiero store sells them, and was curious as to how their products and customer service is.  any info is greatly appreciated.<BR>                      -Jess<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Gokart||02-27-2000||07:30 PM||||Orange was not a color offered by the factory for any year Fiero and I've never seen one painted orange and don't think I'd want to! As for the Fiero Store they are tops! Quick shipping and always friendly and helpful. Their prices can be beat though.||||reg||1
